  "description": "VIXMEU crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C42 H99 Ce4 O15. From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce2 (Ce) has 7 O neighbors; Ce1B (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce2B (Ce) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.596-4.353 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.35-152.23°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Ce4O(OiPr)13(iPrOH). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 13 OiPr (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
